1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:02,548
(Amy:)Um...

2
00:00:04,575 --> 00:00:07,485
(Penny:)Did you seriously
just say, "Um"?

3
00:00:08,312 --> 00:00:11,552
(Leonard:)Look, you know I love you,

4
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:15,166
(Leonard:)but you're... you're drunk
and sad and feeling lost--

5
00:00:15,319 --> 00:00:17,989
Okay, so you don't
want to marry me?!

6
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:20,035
(Leonard:)-That is not what I said.
-No, forget it! I take it back!

7
00:00:20,191 --> 00:00:24,101
-Offer's off the table!
-Who's in the mood to laugh?!

8
00:00:26,564 --> 00:00:27,664
(Leonard:)Really not a good time.

9
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:30,402
(Sheldon:)But I used science
to construct the perfect joke.

10
00:00:30,568 --> 00:00:32,108
(Penny:)-I'm gonna go.
-Penny, don't.

11
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:34,270
(Penny:)No, no, I just need to be alone.

12
00:00:38,676 --> 00:00:42,626
(Sheldon:)So, a sandwich, a rabbi
and yo mama walk into a bar.

13
00:00:44,215 --> 00:00:45,215
(Sheldon:)-Where are you going?
-To my room.

14
00:00:45,383 --> 00:00:47,953
(Sheldon:)-Should I follow you?
-No.

15
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:50,399
(Sheldon:)-Leonard, wait.
-What?

16
00:00:50,555 --> 00:01:04,025
(Sheldon:)I forgot to tell you
the sandwich is promiscuous.

